risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Implemented
expected_result: One canonical list command supports repeatable lifecycle filters and all-status output while seven historical list variants remain compatible hidden aliases.
actual_result: "Canonical list filters and seven hidden compatibility aliases now have lifecycle-specific SDK/MCP schemas, canonical-only completions, isolated runtime alias tests, stderr-only deprecation hints, and clean-room payload parity."
